            "review_title": "Review at Cugini - Ristorante Italiano",
            "review_text": "liz\nRome, Italy27 contributions\n0\nGoodness and elegance of Italian cuisine\nNov 2024 • Couples\nAuthentic Italian cuisine executed with a touch of innovation that makes it excellent. Carefully selected and high quality raw materials. You can enjoy first and second courses and also a tasty pizza well leavened. Particular note for the choice of cold cuts. Excellent selection of wines by the glass. All in a truly attractive location, where they have been able to combine oriental charm with Italian elegance. Three-storey building in the city center with very romantic tree-lined terrace and tables inside with air conditioning. \nOwner, as well as chef, welcoming and available to entertain customers with grace and discretion. Service and staff adequate to what is written in the room. Top top top!!\nRead more\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten November 10, 2024",
