            "review_title": "Review at Cugini - Ristorante Italiano",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nA very special restaurant\nApr 2021\nCugini is one of the finest Italian restaurants in Vietnam, hands down, if not Southeast Asia. Chef Nico continually amazes me with high-end casual fare that genuinely has heart and soul.\n\nI don't know where to start with respect to recommendations. I keep coming back for a katsu sandwich and was extremely impressed to see that Chef Nico had developed a suite of eight take-away sandwiches during the pandemic.\n\nDining in is always a treat, especially sitting outside on the second level with a glass (or bottle) of Donnafugata.\n\nI can't say enough good things about Cugini. Try it, you'll thank me later.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 13, 2021",
